  "description": "After following in the footsteps of his late father and becoming a righteous bandit, Mu-Won finds himself on the run from the royal guard. In the midst of his escape, he encounters a suspicious figure who knows his true identity. Cornered by danger, the stranger offers to lend Mu-Won a mysterious cap that renders the wearer invisible. But the gift comes at a cost. In exchange, the stranger begins to set conditions and toy with Mu-Won, turning the night into a dangerous and tempting bargain.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Jeollaeyahandonghwa (전래야한동화) Collection.*",
